  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 301.01 “Adjusted gross business profits” means a business organization’s “gross business profits”, as defined in RSA 77-A:1, III, modified by the additions and deductions provided in RSA 77-A:4.\n\nSource. #4192, eff 12-23-86; ss by #5490, eff 10-19-92; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; ss by #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
